{"src":"en","tgt":"uk","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"uk","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7702.8435230000005,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":9116.319974,"text":"Якщо ви дивилися фільм «Скарб національний», ви можете подумати, що на звороті Декларації незалежності була написана карта скарбів."},{"kind":"audio","t":9281.210935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9285.823349999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9291.146523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9296.295858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9301.617000999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9304.385065999999,"samples":18947,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":13875.866039999999,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14733.779101,"text":"Гарячий шоколад відповідає бельгійським стандартам. Фруктові соки дорогі, але через деякий час ви відчуєте солодкість."},{"kind":"audio","t":14834.740319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14836.483591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14837.17451,"samples":15269,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"audio","t":14849.146794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":14853.415934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14858.563879999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14859.379925999998,"samples":7578,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":22222.326531,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":22955.863928,"text":"Однак це неправда. Хоча на звороті документа щось написано, це не карта скарбів."},{"kind":"audio","t":23019.111002999998,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":23053.371212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23058.649665999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23061.539989,"samples":20842,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":29989.431333,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31154.848613,"text":"Ви також можете скористатися порадами інших урядів, окрім вашого власного, але їхні поради призначені для їхніх громадян."},{"kind":"audio","t":31290.584851999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":31295.56062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":31300.784604999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31305.959549999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":31311.164244999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31314.910224000003,"samples":23405,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"input","t":41295.563074000005,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42426.081204,"text":"Острів Гонконг дав назву території Гонконгу і є місцем, яке багато туристів вважають головним центром уваги."},{"kind":"audio","t":42551.421703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42556.619078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42561.824173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":42567.040948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42572.556337,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42572.826213,"samples":5015,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":49104.990133,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50733.448208,"text":"Кожен, хто збирається їхати в гарячих широтах або через гірські перевали, повинен врахувати можливість снігу, льоду або обледеніння."},{"kind":"audio","t":50880.882168000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50885.973735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50890.971593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50896.171248000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50901.371463,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50906.066666000006,"samples":29535,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":58795.283832,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59890.711274,"text":"Сегрегація та рекомбінація переміщують варіативність туди й сюди між двома пулами."},{"kind":"audio","t":59988.515905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59993.572523,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59998.633400000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60003.393312,"samples":28755,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":61185.380209,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61544.481668,"text":"з кожним поколінням."},{"kind":"audio","t":61582.212821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61582.582095000005,"samples":4290,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":66497.758651,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67446.70010799999,"text":"Термін «клоп» використовується ентомологами у формальному значенні для цієї групи комах."},{"kind":"audio","t":67546.62222399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67551.656792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67556.804228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67561.715118,"samples":29870,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"input","t":74689.625189,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":76070.87196799999,"text":"По-перше, більшість вершників носять riding-чоботи на підборах і з гладкою, досить вузькою підошвою."},{"kind":"audio","t":76187.685539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76192.719566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76197.784814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76203.086557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76204.393506,"samples":11312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":83915.783619,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":85014.39358799999,"text":"Комісія стала відповіддю Мартеллі на масові антирежимні протести, що розпочалися в жовтні."},{"kind":"audio","t":85112.230809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85113.457709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85115.116862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85116.664987,"samples":32656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"input","t":91131.54734399999,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92019.163183,"text":"Пожежники врешті-решт загасили вогонь до 23:35."},{"kind":"audio","t":92075.97631499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92077.65215699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":92077.84127399999,"samples":1058,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97366.608283,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98388.58261499999,"text":"Напружений шторм атлантичного сезону ураганів, субтропічний шторм Джеррі,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98477.457862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98483.09144999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98487.97181999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98490.608287,"samples":14544,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":100223.659005,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100754.216671,"text":"сформувався сьогодні в Атлантичному океані."},{"kind":"audio","t":100809.177593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100812.00682699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":100812.206343,"samples":1058,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107238.21479,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107985.813828,"text":"Це змусило нас навчити автомобіль та багато інших транспортних засобів."},{"kind":"audio","t":108066.087456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108071.122704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108076.299279,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108077.704696,"samples":11201,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":116619.21786799999,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117889.49288199999,"text":"Воно відоме тим, що було епіцентром розкоші, який виник приблизно 400 року н. е. і тривав до"},{"kind":"audio","t":117996.756658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118001.729417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":118006.765994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118008.85829999999,"samples":15102,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"audio","t":118011.432648,"samples":15325,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":530},{"kind":"audio","t":118018.098069,"samples":22291,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":120746.586063,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121284.387101,"text":"приблизно 1100 року н. е."},{"kind":"audio","t":121332.70522199999,"samples":25913,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":121334.19002699999,"samples":11145,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":127058.419856,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127802.802297,"text":"Поверхня Місяця складається з гірських порід і пилу. Зовнішній шар Місяця називається корою."},{"kind":"audio","t":127897.44565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127898.878566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":127899.519496,"samples":16383,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":610},{"kind":"audio","t":127901.07469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127902.765053,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127902.99934899999,"samples":2173,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":134215.372183,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135452.848743,"text":"Інженерний корпус США оцінив, що шість дюймів опадів можуть призвести до прориву раніше пошкодженої"},{"kind":"audio","t":135580.732782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135585.79931899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135590.83276699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135596.17785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135599.990737,"samples":24687,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"input","t":141189.918032,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142538.597224,"text":"Зокрема, стверджується, що можна визначити, чи бреше людина, правильно інтерпретуючи мікровирази обличчя."},{"kind":"audio","t":142656.068394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142661.141971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142666.402855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142671.50341099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142674.934045,"samples":21900,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":147237.721252,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":148161.157726,"text":"Не псуйте вигляд об'єкта, наносячи графіті або дряпаючи конструкцію."},{"kind":"audio","t":148263.955755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148268.869075,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148274.140929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148278.149443,"samples":25411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":154880.47153799998,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156152.305505,"text":"Рик тигра не схожий на повноголосий рев лева, а більше на речення з гарчальних, викрикнутих слів."},{"kind":"audio","t":156257.103082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156262.12728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":156267.446153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":156272.671308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156274.15944299998,"samples":12148,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":161913.983753,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163156.953542,"text":"Дослідження XX століття показали, що існують два пули генетичної варіативності: прихована та експресована."},{"kind":"audio","t":163277.541901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163282.56242899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163287.756554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163290.44981,"samples":19281,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"audio","t":163295.97462999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163297.381367,"samples":11814,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"close","t":173305.418833,"code":1005}]}